1
00:00:00,510 --> 00:00:01,870
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:01,870 --> 00:00:03,610
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:05,110
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:06,710 --> 00:00:07,710
(Episode 59)

5
00:00:19,490 --> 00:00:20,690
Yes, it's true.

6
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:25,930
I'm the one who gave birth to you.

7
00:00:29,530 --> 00:00:31,600
How can you be my biological mother?

8
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:35,410
You were my mom's secretary...

9
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:37,210
and my nanny.

10
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:39,840
I was.

11
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:44,580
Because I had to stay by your side
and watch over you.

12
00:00:45,750 --> 00:00:47,520
No, that can't be true!

13
00:00:49,950 --> 00:00:51,820
Fine, it's a lie.

14
00:00:53,190 --> 00:00:56,560
You aren't my daughter,
nor are you Kim Jung Sun's daughter.

15
00:01:01,130 --> 00:01:04,800
You're Kang Hae Ra,
daughter of Cheongma.

16
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:08,270
Nothing changes.

17
00:01:09,540 --> 00:01:10,910
No matter who gave birth to you,

18
00:01:11,810 --> 00:01:14,680
the fact that you own Cheongma
will never change.

19
00:01:15,410 --> 00:01:16,450
Does that even make sense?

20
00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:20,550
If I'm not my parents' daughter,
how can I inherit Cheongma?

21
00:01:23,620 --> 00:01:24,720
It's all over now.

22
00:01:26,390 --> 00:01:27,590
The owner of Cheongma?

23
00:01:31,230 --> 00:01:33,570
My entire life is ruined.

24
00:01:34,130 --> 00:01:35,830
No. It's not over.

25
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,400
You're just getting started.

26
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:41,710
Cheongma will be yours.

27
00:01:42,670 --> 00:01:44,410
I'll make sure of it.

28
00:01:47,780 --> 00:01:49,350
What am I to you, Director Joo?

29
00:01:55,990 --> 00:01:58,660
You wanted to own Cheongma,
didn't you?

30
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:01,590
That's why you used me.

31
00:02:03,130 --> 00:02:04,200
Look at you right now.

32
00:02:04,930 --> 00:02:06,660
You don't feel the slightest guilt
as a mother.

33
00:02:06,730 --> 00:02:08,830
All you care about
is taking over Cheongma.

34
00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:20,040
Sure.

35
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:25,550
You may not understand how I feel,

36
00:02:28,420 --> 00:02:29,490
but remember this.

37
00:02:31,860 --> 00:02:32,860
Back then,

38
00:02:33,990 --> 00:02:37,230
handing you over to Kim Jung Sun...

39
00:02:39,230 --> 00:02:41,000
was the best choice I could make.

40
00:02:43,540 --> 00:02:46,670
For your sake, and for mine.

41
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:53,040
Forget it.

42
00:02:55,310 --> 00:02:57,780
I can't believe
a single word you say anymore.

43
00:02:59,850 --> 00:03:00,990
Not even your tears.

44
00:03:05,190 --> 00:03:06,190
Hae Ra.

45
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,400
I'm...

46
00:03:11,830 --> 00:03:12,830
I'm sorry.

47
00:03:27,010 --> 00:03:28,410
(Head of Design Team, Kang Hae Ra)

48
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:31,750
You aren't my daughter,
nor are you Kim Jung Sun's daughter.

49
00:03:32,450 --> 00:03:35,890
You're Kang Hae Ra,
daughter of Cheongma.

50
00:03:38,590 --> 00:03:39,820
Nothing changes.

51
00:03:41,260 --> 00:03:42,530
No matter who gave birth to you,

52
00:03:43,760 --> 00:03:45,330
the fact that you own Cheongma...

53
00:03:46,230 --> 00:03:47,630
will never change.

54
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:54,670
(Head of Design Team, Kang Hae Ra)

55
00:04:00,480 --> 00:04:01,510
We're back.

56
00:04:02,010 --> 00:04:03,680
Ms. Kang, I see you're still here.

57
00:04:05,150 --> 00:04:06,780
Right, good job today.

58
00:04:14,190 --> 00:04:18,460
(PR Director Joo Mi Ran)

59
00:04:20,300 --> 00:04:21,300
Right.

60
00:04:22,970 --> 00:04:24,440
This is actually for the best.

61
00:04:26,370 --> 00:04:28,310
Now Hae Ra will come to her senses.

62
00:04:29,940 --> 00:04:31,980
She'll want to hold on
to her position even more.

63
00:04:33,140 --> 00:04:34,550
Nothing changes.

64
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:39,380
Grandma,

65
00:04:40,620 --> 00:04:43,990
I bought you a nice blouse.

66
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,560
What?

67
00:04:46,020 --> 00:04:47,730
This came out of nowhere.

68
00:04:48,490 --> 00:04:50,530
I've only ever
given you cash before.

69
00:04:50,930 --> 00:04:52,800
I thought this color
would look perfect on you.

70
00:04:53,430 --> 00:04:55,500
How lovely!

71
00:04:56,570 --> 00:04:59,270
How long has it been
since I got brand-new clothes?

72
00:04:59,570 --> 00:05:01,370
Eun Seol, thank you.

73
00:05:03,110 --> 00:05:04,710
- And...
- Yes?

74
00:05:04,780 --> 00:05:06,840
Here's a shirt and tie for you, Dad.

75
00:05:08,180 --> 00:05:10,280
You're always working
on your resume,

76
00:05:10,280 --> 00:05:11,750
so wear this to your interviews.

77
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:14,020
Eun Seol, my gosh.

78
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,430
And...

79
00:05:21,030 --> 00:05:22,060
Here.

80
00:05:22,590 --> 00:05:25,000
Eun Guk, buy Mi Rae
something nice with this.

81
00:05:26,460 --> 00:05:28,570
Where did you get the money
for all this?

82
00:05:29,030 --> 00:05:30,030
I got a bonus.

83
00:05:30,940 --> 00:05:31,940
A bonus?

84
00:05:31,940 --> 00:05:34,810
I was always at the office late,
completely buried in work.

85
00:05:35,210 --> 00:05:37,740
The company gave me a bonus
for working so hard.

86
00:05:37,910 --> 00:05:41,480
Right, our Eun Seol
has been working really hard.

87
00:05:42,410 --> 00:05:44,380
If this is what you get
for working hard,

88
00:05:44,450 --> 00:05:46,620
it's worth the grind.

89
00:05:47,450 --> 00:05:50,120
They say struggling when you're young
builds character.

90
00:05:50,390 --> 00:05:52,320
I don't need any of this.

91
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:55,830
Just tell them to let you
get off work on time from now on.

92
00:05:57,300 --> 00:05:58,300
Dad.

93
00:05:58,960 --> 00:06:00,870
I'm giving this back to you.

94
00:06:02,300 --> 00:06:03,840
This is yours, so why...

95
00:06:04,100 --> 00:06:05,200
I'm not leaving.

96
00:06:05,670 --> 00:06:07,840
I'll just stay and live here.

97
00:06:10,740 --> 00:06:12,910
Good, you made the right call.

98
00:06:13,510 --> 00:06:14,880
Until you get married,

99
00:06:15,180 --> 00:06:16,610
stay right by your dad's side.

100
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:19,780
Okay. And since I'm not moving out,

101
00:06:19,950 --> 00:06:21,920
put this toward
your retirement fund, Dad.

102
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:26,790
You really have grown up.

103
00:06:31,100 --> 00:06:32,700
This is a gift from Mom.

104
00:06:33,130 --> 00:06:34,130
Treasure it.

105
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:48,270
Unbelievable.

106
00:07:49,370 --> 00:07:52,540
I've got enough
of a headache as it is,

107
00:07:53,340 --> 00:07:55,350
and now Ko Eun Seol
is acting out like this?

108
00:08:07,730 --> 00:08:10,490
Are those all real designer?

109
00:08:13,760 --> 00:08:15,770
I got them all as gifts.

110
00:08:16,830 --> 00:08:19,040
Really? They look super expensive.

111
00:08:19,770 --> 00:08:21,510
Eun Seol,
are you seeing someone new?

112
00:08:22,070 --> 00:08:23,070
No.

113
00:08:25,080 --> 00:08:27,510
Ms. Kang's out sick today.

114
00:08:28,210 --> 00:08:30,650
That explains
why she looked so sick yesterday.

115
00:08:30,650 --> 00:08:31,650
Totally.

116
00:08:45,460 --> 00:08:47,370
Why don't we grab some tea
in my office?

117
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:53,440
I need to go see the scholarship
foundation director for a moment.

118
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:54,840
Go ahead.

119
00:09:06,050 --> 00:09:07,750
Hey, come in.

120
00:09:08,790 --> 00:09:10,520
I called you over for a cup of tea.

121
00:09:11,590 --> 00:09:12,960
I missed you, too.

122
00:09:13,020 --> 00:09:15,730
Right. Drink your tea first
before it gets cold.

123
00:09:23,070 --> 00:09:26,200
So, did you register
for the classes?

124
00:09:27,070 --> 00:09:28,070
No.

125
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:31,580
Something feels more important
than language school right now.

126
00:09:32,380 --> 00:09:33,710
Like what?

127
00:09:34,210 --> 00:09:35,980
First, as your daughter,

128
00:09:36,050 --> 00:09:38,750
I figured I should at least
look the part.

129
00:09:39,450 --> 00:09:42,450
I'm the daughter of Cheongma
Scholarship Foundation's director,

130
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,660
so I can't keep living
like I used to.

131
00:09:45,620 --> 00:09:48,690
Well, do you really need to change?

132
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:50,730
After all, only the two of us know.

133
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:53,460
Just in case word gets out.

134
00:09:53,630 --> 00:09:55,900
When it does, I don't want to bring
any trouble onto you.

135
00:09:56,700 --> 00:09:57,740
In everyone else's eyes,

136
00:09:57,740 --> 00:10:00,470
I have to live up
to being your daughter.

137
00:10:02,870 --> 00:10:06,580
I like you best
when you're just being yourself.

138
00:10:06,910 --> 00:10:08,910
So you don't need to try so hard.

139
00:10:09,150 --> 00:10:11,250
You're precious
just the way you are.

140
00:10:12,650 --> 00:10:15,990
I honestly love this makeover.

141
00:10:16,950 --> 00:10:18,320
Dressing up like this...

142
00:10:18,390 --> 00:10:20,260
makes me look
even more like you, Mom.

143
00:10:20,860 --> 00:10:23,130
Don't I look like
a younger version of you?

144
00:10:23,130 --> 00:10:25,300
Yes, you do.

145
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:27,600
This outfit's from Swerang, too.

146
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:29,200
Looks good on me, right?

147
00:10:29,930 --> 00:10:31,000
Yes.

148
00:10:31,070 --> 00:10:32,200
It looks good on you.

149
00:10:33,070 --> 00:10:34,870
Thanks for the credit card, Mom.

150
00:10:35,110 --> 00:10:38,740
I'll make sure to keep
spending responsibly like this.

151
00:10:40,410 --> 00:10:42,580
Sure. Have your tea.

152
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:53,660
(CEO Kang Young Hoon)

153
00:10:54,830 --> 00:10:57,830
I heard Hae Ra called in sick today.

154
00:10:58,430 --> 00:10:59,430
Excuse me?

155
00:11:00,700 --> 00:11:02,730
What? You haven't heard?

156
00:11:03,230 --> 00:11:05,600
I'll give her a call later on.

157
00:11:05,870 --> 00:11:08,840
Is there something going on
with Hae Ra lately?

158
00:11:09,570 --> 00:11:12,280
I hardly ever see her
at home these days.

159
00:11:15,850 --> 00:11:17,980
Are you just as clueless?

160
00:11:19,220 --> 00:11:21,790
I'll go visit her
during lunch today.

161
00:11:22,420 --> 00:11:25,590
I get that I might not know
about Hae Ra,

162
00:11:25,660 --> 00:11:27,790
but shouldn't you be the one
who does?

163
00:11:28,730 --> 00:11:30,360
I'll pay more attention.

164
00:11:30,530 --> 00:11:32,230
If you want to score points with me,

165
00:11:32,230 --> 00:11:33,730
how much you care...

166
00:11:34,070 --> 00:11:35,670
for my daughter matters far more...

167
00:11:35,870 --> 00:11:37,870
than how you're evaluated at work.

168
00:11:38,170 --> 00:11:39,770
Don't you know that?

169
00:11:41,810 --> 00:11:43,070
I'll keep that in mind.

170
00:11:45,640 --> 00:11:47,010
(Planning Director, Cha Seok Jin)

171
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:48,750
If you want to score points with me,

172
00:11:48,750 --> 00:11:50,210
how much you care...

173
00:11:50,610 --> 00:11:52,220
for my daughter matters far more...

174
00:11:52,420 --> 00:11:54,420
than how you're evaluated at work.

175
00:11:54,690 --> 00:11:56,520
Don't you know that?

176
00:12:07,260 --> 00:12:08,970
Hae Ra, how bad are you feeling?

177
00:12:10,870 --> 00:12:12,200
I'll head over
to your place right now.

178
00:12:19,910 --> 00:12:21,050
Are you feeling that bad?

179
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:24,150
You should've called me.

180
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:27,950
Whatever. I'm just annoyed.

181
00:12:39,730 --> 00:12:42,130
You have a fever.
Did you see a doctor?

182
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:48,040
Seok Jin.

183
00:12:49,510 --> 00:12:51,280
I'm marrying you no matter what.

184
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:53,310
Weren't you planning on doing that?

185
00:12:54,510 --> 00:12:56,380
I'll definitely marry you...

186
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:58,980
and take over
the Cheongma Scholarship Foundation.

187
00:13:00,020 --> 00:13:01,090
Kang Hae Ra.

188
00:13:01,950 --> 00:13:03,320
Something happened, didn't it?

189
00:13:04,920 --> 00:13:06,390
Tell me. What's going on?

190
00:13:07,090 --> 00:13:09,560
No. Nothing's going on.

191
00:13:10,030 --> 00:13:11,760
Something like that is no big deal.

192
00:13:12,330 --> 00:13:13,560
Then what is this about?

193
00:13:15,530 --> 00:13:17,370
So don't give up either, Seok Jin.

194
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:20,400
Aim high,
just like you've been doing.

195
00:13:20,800 --> 00:13:22,440
Me and Cheongma both.

196
00:13:23,140 --> 00:13:24,740
Fight hard and make it yours.

197
00:13:27,680 --> 00:13:28,910
All right, I understand.

198
00:13:30,380 --> 00:13:31,650
I hear you,

199
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:33,650
now get up and get dressed.

200
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:34,720
I'm taking you to a doctor.

201
00:13:48,300 --> 00:13:51,670
I'm done trusting anyone.
I'll only trust myself.

202
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:53,870
So...

203
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:56,570
Help me, Seok Jin.

204
00:14:01,880 --> 00:14:02,880
All right.

205
00:14:04,450 --> 00:14:05,550
I will.

206
00:14:19,860 --> 00:14:22,670
(October 29: Attorney Seo
is murdered in a warehouse.)

207
00:14:25,170 --> 00:14:27,270
(Afterward, Eun Guk discovers
a Swerang glove nearby.)

208
00:14:33,340 --> 00:14:36,310
Eun Seol, if you're free,
want to swing by my cafe?

209
00:14:36,750 --> 00:14:38,380
We could grab a beer together.

210
00:14:40,680 --> 00:14:43,520
Yes, sounds great.
I'll head over right now.

211
00:14:45,890 --> 00:14:48,430
I sometimes have a drink alone
before heading home.

212
00:14:48,630 --> 00:14:51,060
Today, I felt like grabbing
a drink with you.

213
00:14:52,100 --> 00:14:54,970
Me too.
We were thinking the same thing.

214
00:14:55,800 --> 00:14:56,900
I'm glad.

215
00:14:58,170 --> 00:15:00,000
By the way,
what made you cut your hair?

216
00:15:01,610 --> 00:15:02,670
Does it look weird?

217
00:15:02,740 --> 00:15:06,110
No, you look great
no matter how you wear your hair.

218
00:15:06,510 --> 00:15:09,980
Honestly, you seem
in much better spirits.

219
00:15:11,620 --> 00:15:14,790
Are you sure
nothing's wrong, though?

220
00:15:17,090 --> 00:15:18,090
It's just...

221
00:15:18,520 --> 00:15:20,420
I felt pathetic, that's all.

222
00:15:22,730 --> 00:15:25,130
I let a little warmth blind me,

223
00:15:25,630 --> 00:15:27,830
opened up my heart way too fast,

224
00:15:28,470 --> 00:15:29,830
and trusted completely.

225
00:15:30,730 --> 00:15:32,700
It happens to the best of us.

226
00:15:32,970 --> 00:15:34,310
When you're exhausted
and struggling,

227
00:15:34,310 --> 00:15:36,570
any bit of warmth
feels twice as sweet.

228
00:15:37,210 --> 00:15:38,680
That's why I want to change.

229
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:41,450
Changing is the only way...

230
00:15:41,680 --> 00:15:44,450
I'll ever uncover the truth behind
Attorney Seo's wrongful death.

231
00:15:46,150 --> 00:15:49,020
So I decided to switch up my style.

232
00:15:51,590 --> 00:15:52,820
Ko Eun Seol.

233
00:15:53,020 --> 00:15:54,090
I mean...

234
00:15:54,630 --> 00:15:55,630
Eun Seol.

235
00:15:58,430 --> 00:16:01,000
Don't overdo it
trying to repay Hyun Jae.

236
00:16:01,970 --> 00:16:04,230
He wouldn't want that either.

237
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:06,840
If you keep pushing yourself
so hard all the time,

238
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:08,510
you'll just burn out.

239
00:16:08,940 --> 00:16:09,970
It'll drain you.

240
00:16:10,540 --> 00:16:11,540
Just...

241
00:16:12,310 --> 00:16:14,680
live normally, like everyone else.

242
00:16:17,410 --> 00:16:19,150
Whenever things get tough,
come on by.

243
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:21,120
I could always use a drinking buddy.

244
00:16:22,820 --> 00:16:24,520
Okay, I will.

245
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:27,420
Also...

246
00:16:27,560 --> 00:16:29,090
From now on,
if you're going to the salon,

247
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:30,930
run it by me first.

248
00:16:32,560 --> 00:16:34,130
Does it look that bad?

249
00:16:34,830 --> 00:16:38,170
I just mean we can get a discount
if we go together.

250
00:16:38,570 --> 00:16:40,070
Next time, we'll go together.

251
00:16:40,570 --> 00:16:41,640
Sounds good.

252
00:16:43,110 --> 00:16:44,110
Cheers.

253
00:16:56,790 --> 00:16:58,890
"Premium..."

254
00:16:59,360 --> 00:17:02,660
"assisted living facility."

255
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:05,660
Assisted living?

256
00:17:10,970 --> 00:17:12,040
Then...

257
00:17:12,470 --> 00:17:13,740
is Mr. Seok Jin...

258
00:17:14,510 --> 00:17:16,410
leaving me too?

259
00:17:17,310 --> 00:17:19,140
Just like my darling did?

260
00:17:22,210 --> 00:17:23,780
Hey, you're home.

261
00:17:23,780 --> 00:17:24,780
Where's Mom?

262
00:17:24,850 --> 00:17:25,850
In her room.

263
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:29,620
I don't know what set her off,
but she's in a really bad mood.

264
00:17:30,050 --> 00:17:31,590
Did something happen at daycare?

265
00:17:31,660 --> 00:17:33,690
No, nothing unusual.

266
00:17:35,530 --> 00:17:37,460
All right, you should head home.
I'll check on her.

267
00:17:37,530 --> 00:17:40,060
Okay. Try to cheer her up.

268
00:17:40,460 --> 00:17:42,470
- Thank you for today.
- Sure, get some rest.

269
00:17:48,610 --> 00:17:51,110
Mom, are you not feeling well?

270
00:17:55,950 --> 00:17:57,080
Mom?

271
00:17:59,280 --> 00:18:02,020
I'm going to bed. Go away.

272
00:18:02,650 --> 00:18:05,390
Mom, don't you even want
to look at me?

273
00:18:06,490 --> 00:18:07,490
You're right,

274
00:18:07,690 --> 00:18:09,330
I don't.

275
00:18:11,860 --> 00:18:13,330
Is someone pouting?

276
00:18:13,930 --> 00:18:16,130
Did you and Aunt Soon Young fight
at daycare again?

277
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:20,040
I'm going to sleep. Just get out.

278
00:18:20,070 --> 00:18:21,240
All right.

279
00:18:22,340 --> 00:18:24,680
We'll talk about it
in the morning, okay?

280
00:18:40,320 --> 00:18:42,460
No. It's not over.

281
00:18:43,390 --> 00:18:44,900
You're just getting started.

282
00:18:45,630 --> 00:18:47,660
Cheongma will be yours.

283
00:18:47,830 --> 00:18:50,000
I'll make sure of it.

284
00:18:51,270 --> 00:18:52,270
Right.

285
00:18:52,900 --> 00:18:54,640
Cheongma belongs to me.

286
00:18:55,870 --> 00:18:57,910
I'll make Cheongma mine.

287
00:19:09,820 --> 00:19:12,220
Are you sure
you're up for work today?

288
00:19:12,390 --> 00:19:14,390
You could always get
a little more rest.

289
00:19:15,530 --> 00:19:17,460
I already took time off to go
on that trip.

290
00:19:17,900 --> 00:19:19,900
Besides, I have a design meeting
for next season,

291
00:19:19,960 --> 00:19:21,970
and I need to be
at the scholarship program meeting.

292
00:19:24,740 --> 00:19:28,110
It seems like our daughter
has finally grown up.

293
00:19:28,640 --> 00:19:29,640
I know.

294
00:19:30,040 --> 00:19:32,680
I'm planning to take more interest
in the company from now on.

295
00:19:32,980 --> 00:19:34,510
The more invested I am
in the company,

296
00:19:34,580 --> 00:19:36,250
the quicker I can learn the ropes.

297
00:19:36,250 --> 00:19:37,880
I'll work hard...

298
00:19:38,150 --> 00:19:39,850
and follow
in both of your footsteps.

299
00:19:39,950 --> 00:19:42,250
Look at you.
Getting engaged to Chief Cha...

300
00:19:42,590 --> 00:19:45,390
has really changed you.

301
00:19:45,690 --> 00:19:48,060
We should thank him, shouldn't we?

302
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:54,600
He helped, of course,

303
00:19:54,970 --> 00:19:56,700
but Director Joo influenced me
even more.

304
00:19:57,430 --> 00:19:59,470
She's always had my back...

305
00:20:00,140 --> 00:20:01,810
and kept me from losing focus.

306
00:20:03,470 --> 00:20:04,610
That's true.

307
00:20:05,380 --> 00:20:07,640
We owe a lot of it to her as well.

308
00:20:09,950 --> 00:20:11,180
Not at all.

309
00:20:22,690 --> 00:20:25,400
- Yes, Auntie?
- Seok Jin, what do we do?

310
00:20:25,430 --> 00:20:27,430
Your mom is missing.

311
00:20:27,660 --> 00:20:28,700
My mom?

312
00:20:28,870 --> 00:20:30,100
While we were waiting
for the shuttle,

313
00:20:30,170 --> 00:20:32,570
she said she was thirsty,
so I went to buy some water.

314
00:20:32,700 --> 00:20:34,740
And she just vanished
in those few minutes.

315
00:20:34,810 --> 00:20:36,170
I'll head there right now.

316
00:20:36,270 --> 00:20:38,080
Please report it
to the police first.

317
00:20:38,510 --> 00:20:41,080
Okay, all right. Hurry over.

318
00:20:42,480 --> 00:20:45,120
Oh, right.
I met with Eun Seol yesterday.

319
00:20:46,080 --> 00:20:48,090
- With Eun Seol?
- Yes.

320
00:20:48,920 --> 00:20:52,460
I really don't think her haircut's
anything to worry about.

321
00:20:52,620 --> 00:20:54,630
Why did she cut her hair then?

322
00:20:55,130 --> 00:20:57,460
She said it wasn't because
of anything specific,

323
00:20:57,660 --> 00:20:59,300
but more like a resolution...

324
00:20:59,360 --> 00:21:01,230
to live a better life
moving forward.

325
00:21:01,370 --> 00:21:02,530
I see.

326
00:21:03,230 --> 00:21:04,230
I was worried...

327
00:21:04,270 --> 00:21:06,670
something else had happened
that we didn't know about.

328
00:21:07,100 --> 00:21:09,640
You know how some days
just hit you like that.

329
00:21:10,040 --> 00:21:11,780
You feel so pathetic for no reason,

330
00:21:12,240 --> 00:21:13,980
and you just feel awful
about yourself.

331
00:21:14,780 --> 00:21:18,520
It sounded like Eun Seol
has been feeling that way lately.

332
00:21:19,220 --> 00:21:21,320
On top of that, I think...

333
00:21:22,550 --> 00:21:25,360
she's still carrying a lot of guilt
about Hyun Jae.

334
00:21:25,420 --> 00:21:26,620
I'm sure she is.

335
00:21:27,690 --> 00:21:29,130
Ever since what happened
to Attorney Seo,

336
00:21:29,530 --> 00:21:31,330
she hasn't had
a single moment of peace.

337
00:21:32,200 --> 00:21:34,030
So I told her to come here...

338
00:21:34,100 --> 00:21:35,570
whenever things get tough
from now on.

339
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:41,710
I want to help her.

340
00:21:43,410 --> 00:21:46,840
Hyun Jae was always worrying
about her.

341
00:21:47,940 --> 00:21:49,650
If Hyun Jae cared that much,

342
00:21:49,710 --> 00:21:52,220
there must've been
a good reason for it.

343
00:21:52,620 --> 00:21:55,490
It means Eun Seol is
that good of a person.

344
00:21:57,790 --> 00:22:01,220
Hyun Jae wanted to protect her
until the very end,

345
00:22:02,460 --> 00:22:04,230
and now I want to pick up
where he left off.

346
00:22:05,360 --> 00:22:09,100
That way, I feel like Hyun Jae
can rest in peace.

347
00:22:18,610 --> 00:22:19,640
Boss.

348
00:22:23,010 --> 00:22:24,280
Want to get married?

349
00:22:32,620 --> 00:22:34,520
Let's get married.

350
00:22:39,360 --> 00:22:41,670
Just focus on company business
for the time being.

351
00:22:42,870 --> 00:22:44,630
I'll handle everything else.

352
00:22:44,970 --> 00:22:46,700
As for An Guk Cheol,

353
00:22:47,170 --> 00:22:50,170
there's a slight chance
he could show up again.

354
00:22:50,410 --> 00:22:51,940
So with a smaller crew, I...

355
00:22:51,940 --> 00:22:53,280
I said it's fine.

356
00:22:53,810 --> 00:22:55,980
There's no way An Guk Cheol
will ever show up again.

357
00:22:56,710 --> 00:22:59,180
Secretary Choi, just do
what I tell you to do.

358
00:22:59,480 --> 00:23:00,480
Right.

359
00:23:01,020 --> 00:23:02,020
Yes, ma'am.

360
00:23:02,920 --> 00:23:06,720
You're busy enough as it is
with just the scholarship program.

361
00:23:07,460 --> 00:23:10,590
Moving forward,
your role in it will expand.

362
00:23:11,030 --> 00:23:14,130
If I can't make it to a meeting,
brief me directly afterward.

363
00:23:14,700 --> 00:23:16,730
Understood. I'll do that.

364
00:23:18,340 --> 00:23:19,500
And one more thing.

365
00:23:21,340 --> 00:23:22,510
Be there for Ms. Kang...

366
00:23:23,340 --> 00:23:25,640
and give her
all the support she needs.

367
00:23:26,540 --> 00:23:28,810
- Ms. Kang?
- You know...

368
00:23:29,210 --> 00:23:32,050
that if the Chairman gains power
in the scholarship foundation,

369
00:23:32,420 --> 00:23:34,020
my position's
on shaky ground, right?

370
00:23:34,080 --> 00:23:36,250
Yes, I'm aware of that.

371
00:23:36,320 --> 00:23:38,460
It works much more in our favor...

372
00:23:38,520 --> 00:23:42,030
if Ms. Kang leads the foundation
rather than the Chairman.

373
00:23:46,800 --> 00:23:47,930
You may leave now.

374
00:23:49,000 --> 00:23:50,930
Yes, ma'am. Then...

375
00:24:02,210 --> 00:24:04,080
If all I do is help Kang Hae Ra,

376
00:24:04,310 --> 00:24:06,380
I'll end up completely useless.

377
00:24:07,920 --> 00:24:09,920
Have I lost the Director's trust?

378
00:24:13,990 --> 00:24:15,130
An Guk Cheol.

379
00:24:16,190 --> 00:24:18,360
If only I hadn't let
that scumbag get away.

380
00:24:22,600 --> 00:24:24,730
I'll catch you no matter what.

381
00:24:34,110 --> 00:24:35,110
(An Guk Cheol)

382
00:24:48,830 --> 00:24:51,490
Don't overdo it
trying to repay Hyun Jae.

383
00:24:52,400 --> 00:24:54,600
He wouldn't want that either.

384
00:24:55,470 --> 00:24:57,230
If you keep pushing yourself
so hard all the time,

385
00:24:57,230 --> 00:24:58,970
you'll just burn out.

386
00:24:59,440 --> 00:25:00,500
It'll drain you.

387
00:25:00,900 --> 00:25:01,940
Just...

388
00:25:02,770 --> 00:25:04,940
live normally, like everyone else.

389
00:25:06,180 --> 00:25:10,510
Is Director Joo really connected
to Attorney Seo's death?

390
00:25:14,180 --> 00:25:16,550
I need something more concrete.

391
00:25:20,620 --> 00:25:22,130
You should've told me beforehand.

392
00:25:22,230 --> 00:25:25,330
Then your dad would've
dressed up nicely for you.

393
00:25:26,360 --> 00:25:28,870
I'm tracking down
the swapped kid right now.

394
00:25:29,500 --> 00:25:32,040
Since the foster mom
who raised you was an actress,

395
00:25:32,170 --> 00:25:33,770
there was quite a lot to dig up.

396
00:25:33,840 --> 00:25:37,510
There are articles about the birth,
and she did interviews, too.

397
00:25:42,050 --> 00:25:43,050
What the...

398
00:25:44,310 --> 00:25:46,120
Sweetheart, what are you doing?

399
00:25:46,220 --> 00:25:48,850
Do you know how hard it was
to get these articles?

400
00:25:49,520 --> 00:25:50,650
Don't look for her.

401
00:25:51,990 --> 00:25:52,990
What?

402
00:25:52,990 --> 00:25:55,030
Stop looking for the girl
I was switched with.

403
00:25:55,930 --> 00:25:57,390
Your mom told you, didn't she?

404
00:25:57,490 --> 00:26:00,530
Who were you switched with?
Where does she live now?

405
00:26:00,900 --> 00:26:02,070
She's dead.

406
00:26:04,100 --> 00:26:05,200
Dead?

407
00:26:07,400 --> 00:26:09,110
She's dead,
so it doesn't matter anymore.

408
00:26:09,670 --> 00:26:11,170
So stop looking for her.

409
00:26:12,440 --> 00:26:13,440
Is that true?

410
00:26:13,510 --> 00:26:16,210
She's dead, okay?
So stop looking for her!

411
00:26:16,680 --> 00:26:19,280
Mom and Dad's daughter,
Cheongma's daughter...

412
00:26:19,480 --> 00:26:21,550
That's me, Kang Hae Ra,
and nobody else!

413
00:26:22,450 --> 00:26:23,520
Right.

414
00:26:23,720 --> 00:26:25,920
I hear you. Calm down, sweetheart.

415
00:26:26,190 --> 00:26:29,360
Then I won't look
for her anymore, okay?

416
00:26:29,430 --> 00:26:33,230
Of course. Our daughter
is Cheongma's daughter.

417
00:26:33,300 --> 00:26:36,130
You're the only daughter
Cheongma has.

418
00:26:36,830 --> 00:26:39,370
Stay right here until I contact you.

419
00:26:39,540 --> 00:26:41,040
Don't wander around.

420
00:26:41,140 --> 00:26:42,610
Sure, of course.

421
00:26:43,010 --> 00:26:45,240
Whatever our princess says.

422
00:26:45,240 --> 00:26:47,480
Don't worry, my Cheongma Princess.

423
00:26:49,210 --> 00:26:50,710
Seriously!

424
00:26:53,050 --> 00:26:54,120
Dead, my foot.

425
00:26:54,780 --> 00:26:56,950
She's definitely alive somewhere.

426
00:27:00,190 --> 00:27:02,290
I'll find her no matter what.

427
00:27:03,760 --> 00:27:06,760
I need an insurance policy
of my own, too.

428
00:27:11,470 --> 00:27:12,470
Right.

429
00:27:23,480 --> 00:27:25,450
Director, just a moment.

430
00:27:36,990 --> 00:27:37,990
All done.

431
00:27:38,130 --> 00:27:39,130
Thanks.

432
00:28:01,080 --> 00:28:03,490
I'm sorry. Are you all right?

433
00:28:05,460 --> 00:28:07,060
Yes, I'm fine.

434
00:28:07,360 --> 00:28:08,460
Hey, let's go.

435
00:28:36,620 --> 00:28:38,960
Mom?

436
00:28:41,220 --> 00:28:42,230
Mom?

437
00:28:50,070 --> 00:28:51,070
Yes, Auntie.

438
00:28:52,140 --> 00:28:53,140
She's not at home either.

439
00:28:54,970 --> 00:28:56,270
Okay, I'll head over there.

440
00:29:13,860 --> 00:29:15,660
(Cheongun Gaon
Senior Care Residence)

441
00:29:45,190 --> 00:29:46,190
What's this?

442
00:29:52,660 --> 00:29:55,770
Has Director Joo always been into
this kind of style?

443
00:29:56,930 --> 00:29:58,670
Her taste is pretty old-fashioned.

444
00:30:07,780 --> 00:30:09,010
Could this be...

445
00:30:36,970 --> 00:30:37,970
Yes?

446
00:30:39,980 --> 00:30:41,040
Hey, you're here.

447
00:30:44,010 --> 00:30:45,780
I ran into the courier on my way in.

448
00:30:46,220 --> 00:30:47,720
I think it's addressed to you.

449
00:30:48,120 --> 00:30:49,120
Really?

450
00:30:50,790 --> 00:30:53,360
Go ahead and open it.
It looks like a gift.

451
00:30:54,290 --> 00:30:56,290
Is that so? What could it be?

452
00:30:57,730 --> 00:31:01,260
It's probably
from the orphanage I sponsor.

453
00:31:11,140 --> 00:31:13,910
Looks like it came with a card.

454
00:31:15,010 --> 00:31:16,750
Oh, is that so?

455
00:31:22,220 --> 00:31:24,050
(I know everything you did.)

456
00:31:25,920 --> 00:31:26,960
(I know everything you did.)

457
00:31:33,460 --> 00:31:35,930
It's from that orphanage after all.

458
00:31:35,930 --> 00:31:37,830
I left one of my gloves there.

459
00:31:38,000 --> 00:31:39,000
Right.

460
00:32:12,840 --> 00:32:16,540
(A Trap Called Desire)

461
00:32:16,810 --> 00:32:18,810
Mom, why did you go there though?

462
00:32:18,880 --> 00:32:20,780
That's the factory
Dad used to work at.

463
00:32:20,780 --> 00:32:22,950
I remembered that day.

464
00:32:22,950 --> 00:32:24,650
After my father's accident,

465
00:32:24,650 --> 00:32:27,380
did you happen to see my mother
at the factory?

466
00:32:27,420 --> 00:32:29,690
I felt like I should tell
you and Dad in advance.

467
00:32:29,750 --> 00:32:30,890
I'm going to propose.

468
00:32:30,890 --> 00:32:33,090
Where did you buy this underwear?

469
00:32:33,090 --> 00:32:35,120
That hometown friend of yours...

470
00:32:35,220 --> 00:32:37,560
certainly has unique taste.

471
00:32:37,760 --> 00:32:40,100
Why is she trying so hard
to get rid of me?

472
00:32:40,130 --> 00:32:41,330
Am I more than she can handle?

473
00:32:41,400 --> 00:32:43,370
Who's your mom
always running around with,

474
00:32:43,470 --> 00:32:44,570
leaving her own daughter out?

475
00:32:44,630 --> 00:32:46,340
You're in touch with An Guk Cheol?

476
00:32:46,400 --> 00:32:49,240
Don't tell me you've actually
gotten attached to him.

477
00:32:49,310 --> 00:32:51,610
What, is blood really thicker
than water?

478
00:32:52,640 --> 00:32:54,640
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
